<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyzstan has $233.7 mln Jan-Aug trade deficit.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyzstan has $233.7 mln Jan-Aug trade deficit.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan posted a trade deficit of $233.7 million in the first eight months of 1996 after a $30.4 million surplus in the same period of 1995, the National Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>KYRGYZ MERCHANDISE TRADE Jan-Aug 96  Jan-Jul 96  Jan-Aug 95</p>
<p>    Exports			  306.4	 268.1	  87.4</p>
<p>    Imports			  540.1	 493.6	  57.0</p>
<p>    Balance			 -233.7	-225.5	  30.4</p>
<p>Notes -- Figures in million dollars, FOB.</p>
<p>--Almaty newsroom +73272 509410</p>
</text>
